<title>UK: LB Schleswig-Holstein sets $100 mln four-year bond.</title>
<headline>LB Schleswig-Holstein sets $100 mln four-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by joint lead managers Kredietbank and CIBC WoodGundy.</p>
<p> BORROWER   LANDESBANK SCHLESWIG-HOLSTEIN GIROZENTRALE</p>
<p> AMT    $100 MLN	COUPON     6.75 PCT  MATURITY    30.MAY.01</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.06    PAY DATE    30.MAY.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.625     REOFFER    99.66     SPREAD	+16 BP</p>
<p> MOODY	AA1	 LISTING    LUX	 PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  =	   DENOMS (K) 1-5	 SALE LIMITS US/UK</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   HOME CTRY  =	   TAX PROVS   =</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.225     SELL CONC  1.40	PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p> UNDERLYING GOVT BOND U.S. TREASURY DUE FEBRUARY 2000</p>
<p> NOTES	ISSUED OFF THE EMTN PROGRAMME</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
